      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Our story",
        "heading": "",
        "text": "<p>Tabi began with a love for natural fabrics, the hands that work with them, and the small pleasures of everyday life.</p><p>Today, we make clothing for women and children, textiles for the home, and objects meant to become part of the way we live.</p><p>Each is a different expression of the same belief: the things we choose to live with deserve a little thought.</p>",
