      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "The things we return to",
        "text": "<p>Some of the nicest parts of a day are easily overlooked.</p><p>A cup of tea before the house wakes up. A shirt that feels right the moment you put it on. Children running through the last hour of sunlight. The familiar tray you bring out when friends arrive.</p><p>This is the life we design for. It is ordinary, sometimes messy, often beautiful.</p><p>We want the things we make to belong naturally to it.</p>",
