        "eyebrow": "Our roots",
        "heading": "A lifetime in textiles",
        "text": "<p>Our roots go back decades, to a family garment-making business and a lifetime spent understanding cloth.</p><p>Long before Tabi, there were years of working with fabrics, developing designs, refining fits and making garments for people around the world.</p><p>That experience remains part of how we work today.</p><p>We know how much difference the right fabric can make. How a few changes to a cut can alter the way something feels. How the smallest finishing details can make a piece worth keeping.</p><p>Tabi gives us the freedom to bring that knowledge into collections that feel personally meaningful to us.</p>",
        "text_font": "heading",
