      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Our approach",
        "heading": "Made to be worn.\nMade to be lived with.",
        "text": "<p>We have a particular affection for natural fabrics.</p><p>The lightness of cotton cambric. The crisp hand of poplin. The structure of twill. The softness that comes with a well-worn piece of clothing.</p><p>We love handwork, too. The tiny variations in a block print, the character of an embroidered flower, the unexpected charm of patchwork.</p><p>Some of our pieces are quiet and understated. Others have plenty of personality.</p><p>What matters is that they're enjoyable to use, comfortable to live with, and interesting enough to keep coming back to.</p>",
        "text_font": "heading",
        "width": "medium",
        "text_align": "center",
        "text_align_mobile": "center",
        "list_label": "Our approach",
        "row_width": "content",
