    "closing": {
      "type": "story-text",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "The next chapter",
        "heading": "The journey continues",
        "text": "<p>Tabi takes its name from the Japanese word for <em>journey</em>.</p><p>We began with clothing, but our curiosity has always extended to the way we live.</p><p>The fabrics we bring into our homes. The objects we reach for every day. The rituals we share with the people around us.</p><p>As Tabi grows, so will the ways we explore these ideas.</p><p>We don't have a finished picture of everything Tabi will become. And perhaps that's what makes the journey interesting.</p><p>For now, we're glad you're here.</p>",
